      "rationale": "奕完整本傳及三子名單明玄為奕子；玄傳首明叔父安；安傳首明父裒。非據數位兄奕標題，不另造奕父裒原句。",
      "references": [
        {
          "work_id": "w-jinshu",
          "book_id": "b-jinshu-079",
          "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-079-xielang-family",
          "source_id": "s-jinshu-079-xielang-family",
          "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:exp-xieyi-p001",
          "assertion_id": "a-jinshu079-expansion-009",
          "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7079&oldid=2645985",
          "scope": "本段完整引文；各原生陳述作可撤回綜合推論。",
          "quote_start": 0,
          "quote_end": 256,
          "citation_kind": "complete_paragraph",
          "full_paragraph": "奕字無奕，少有名譽。初為剡令，有老人犯法，奕以醇酒飲之，醉猶未已。安時年七八歲，在奕膝邊，諫止之。奕為改容，遣之。與桓溫善。溫辟為安西司馬，猶推布衣好。在溫坐，岸幘笑詠，無異常日。桓溫曰：「我方外司馬。」奕每因酒，無復朝廷禮，嘗逼溫飲，溫走入南康主門避之。主曰：「君若無狂司馬，我何由得相見！」奕遂攜酒就聽事，引溫一兵帥共飲，曰：「失一老兵，得一老兵，亦何所怪。」溫不之責。從兄尚有德政，既卒，為西蕃所思，朝議以奕立行有素，必能嗣尚事，乃遷都督豫司冀並四州軍事、安西將軍、豫州刺史、假節。未幾。卒官，贈鎮西將軍。",
          "full_paragraph_sha256": "5a792c553e801febbb2921afb905021217ac2368fdd7c8dbe7cb084a7a58f631",
          "quote_passage_ref": "data/corpus/jinshu/079.json"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-jinshu",
          "book_id": "b-jinshu-079",
          "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-079-xielang-family",
          "source_id": "s-jinshu-079-xielang-family",
          "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:exp-xieyi-p002",
          "assertion_id": "a-jinshu079-expansion-009",
          "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7079&oldid=2645985",
          "scope": "本段完整引文；各原生陳述作可撤回綜合推論。",
          "quote_start": 0,
          "quote_end": 27,
          "citation_kind": "complete_paragraph",
          "full_paragraph": "三子：泉、靖、玄。泉早有名譽，曆義興太守。靖官至太常。",
          "full_paragraph_sha256": "e1321cb17ed0e7627e180be067854469ab66e6e0069f79347af2e8e5eb22208c",
          "quote_passage_ref": "data/corpus/jinshu/079.json"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-jinshu",
          "book_id": "b-jinshu-079",
          "source_id": "s-jinshu-079-xielang-family",
          "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-079-xielang-family",
          "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:p002",
          "assertion_id": "a-jinshu079-xie-005",
          "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7079&oldid=2645985",
          "scope": "本段完整引文；各原生陳述作可撤回綜合推論。",
          "quote_start": 0,
          "quote_end": 115,
          "citation_kind": "complete_paragraph",
          "full_paragraph": "玄字幼度。少穎悟，與從兄朗俱為叔父安所器重。安嘗戒約子侄，因曰：「子弟亦何豫人事，而正欲使其佳？」諸人莫有言者。玄答曰：「譬如芝蘭玉樹，欲使其生於庭階耳。」安悅。玄少好佩紫羅香囊，安患之，而不欲傷其意，因戲賭取，即焚之，於此遂止。",
          "full_paragraph_sha256": "e8ed9f3f2d8d374b9f5514a2eaafcd74cac15564c9b2143837d26b35d35954b0",
          "quote_passage_ref": "data/corpus/jinshu/079.json"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-jinshu",
          "book_id": "b-jinshu-079",
          "source_id": "s-jinshu-079-xielang-family",
          "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-079-xielang-family",
          "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:p001",
          "assertion_id": "a-jinshu079-xie-001",
          "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7079&oldid=2645985",
          "scope": "本段完整引文；各原生陳述作可撤回綜合推論。",
          "quote_start": 0,
          "quote_end": 127,
          "citation_kind": "complete_paragraph",
          "full_paragraph": "謝安，字安石，尚從弟也。父裒，太常卿。安年四歲時，譙郡桓彝見而歎曰：「此兒風神秀徹，後當不減王東海。」及總角，神識沈敏，風宇條暢，善行書。弱冠，詣王蒙，清言良久，既去，蒙子修曰：「向客何如大人？」蒙曰：「此客亹亹，為來逼人。」王導亦深器之。由是少有重名。",
          "full_paragraph_sha256": "812019dedb73fc9d58a79c6eb6ae3a327f7cc8005412a41c9c76b1e3a5fa0562",
          "quote_passage_ref": "data/corpus/jinshu/079.json"
        }
